-A useful model is:
-
-```text
-protocol wants to close
-  -> connection begins shutdown
-      -> TLS shutdown / close-notify handling
-          -> underlying socket shutdown / close
-              -> disconnect summary
-```
-
-Failures and timeouts can occur during shutdown as well as during setup.
